        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\n2-Bedroom Apartment \n\nWelcome to this brand new first letting of these apartments in Dublin 8!\n\nExperience elevate living in the heart of Dublin 8 with our stunning 2-bedroom apartment, where modern amenities and stylish design combine to create the ultimate urban retreat.\n\nStep into spacious sophistication as you enter the open-plan layout, featuring a sleek kitchen complete with a breakfast island adorned with stools for casual dining. Entertain friends and family effortlessly in the adjoining dining area, complemented by a comfortable living space where you can unwind after a long day.\n\nEmbrace the outdoors on your private balcony, offering a peaceful sanctuary to enjoy the fresh air and city views. Whether it's a morning or evening coffee, this outdoor oasis is yours to savour.\n\nRetreat to the tranquillity of the bedrooms, each boasting fitted wardrobes and ample shelving units for all your storage needs. The main bedroom features a stylish ensuite bathroom, providing added comfort and convenience.\nWith contemporary finishes and abundance of natural light throughout, this apartment exudes a sense of warmth and elegance that welcomes you home.\n\nDon't miss the opportunity to elevate your lifestyle in Dublin 8. Contact us today to schedule a viewing and discover the epitome of modern urban living!\n\n**Please note: \n1) There are multiple property types available in this development. The photos shown here may not be of the actual unit available but represent the standard of finish. \n2) The rent advertised on the individual property ads represent the starting rent for these property types. Rents will vary throughout the development depending on the specific property type. Not all the available properties and rents are listed here; please use those available at viewings. \n3) The overall BER Rating on this development is A Rated, an individual BER cert for your specific apartment is available on move in, upon request. \n4) Amenities are subject to different opening times than apartment move in dates and are tied in with overall development time frame and may be subject to change."
      },
